{"seq":1,"slug":"a-controversial-figure","title":"A Controversial Figure","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/a-controversial-figure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-suppression-of-taiping","title":"镇压太平天国的争议","url":"/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/a-controversial-figure/the-suppression-of-taiping","wordCount":1480,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"loyalty-to-the-qing","title":"忠君与气节之辩","url":"/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/a-controversial-figure/loyalty-to-the-qing","wordCount":1309,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章审视曾国藩作为争议人物的两个方面。\"镇压太平天国的争议\"——曾国藩镇压了规模空前的农民起义、维护了腐朽的清王朝、其湘军更在作战中大肆杀戮，对此不同立场、不同时代有着截然不同的评判，须正视历史的复杂性。\"忠君与气节之辩\"——曾国藩对腐朽清王朝的忠诚，究竟是值得称道的操守气节，还是愚忠的历史局限？本章以审慎、辩证、历史的态度辨析这些争议。\n"}